    "en\u00002026-009: Critical Vulnerabilities in Microsoft SharePoint\n                             \n Thursday, July 23, 2026 09:13:03 AM CEST \n [UPDATED] On 14 July 2026, Microsoft released security updates addressing critical remote code execution (RCE) vulnerabilities in Microsoft SharePoint Server. On 20 July 2026, WatchTowr identified a proof-of-concept exploit code and subsequently observed active exploitation of CVE-2026-50522, a vulnerability part of an ongoing series of actively exploited flaws affecting on-premise SharePoint Server instances, including CVE-2026-32201, CVE-2026-45659, CVE-2026-56164, and CVE-2026-58644. \nCERT-EU strongly recommends updating affected servers immediately, rotating credentials for any assets that may have been exposed to the internet, and conducting a compromise assessment.": {
      "text": "2026-009：Microsoft SharePoint 中的嚴重漏洞\n                             \n 2026 年 7 月 23 日星期四上午 09:13:03 中歐夏令時間\n [已更新] 2026 年 7 月 14 日，Microsoft 發布了安全性更新，解決 Microsoft SharePoint Server 中的關鍵遠端程式碼執行 (RCE) 漏洞。 2026 年 7 月 20 日，WatchTowr 發現了概念驗證漏洞利用程式碼，隨後觀察到 CVE-2026-50522 的主動利用，該漏洞是影響本地 SharePoint Server 例項的一系列持續被主動利用的缺陷的一部分，包括 CVE-2026-32201、CVE-2026-C和CVE-2026-58644。 \nCERT-EU 強烈建議立即更新受影響的伺服器，輪換可能暴露在網路上的任何資產的憑證，並進行妥協評估。",
      "provider": "googletrans",
      "created_at": "2026-07-28T07:47:33.041282+00:00",
      "last_accessed_at": "2026-07-28T07:47:33.041282+00:00"
    },
